Exact small-q proof lab for LRC witness/p0/additive-energy mechanisms
==============================================================================
q is the denominator in threshold 1/q; cluster GOOD_q is maxgap > 2/q.
Banks are primitive anchored shapes E={0,...} with max(E)<=q.

